#: ../../../onboarding/fastapi.rst:823
msgid ""
"Per-route OpenAPI metadata (``tags``, ``summary``, ``description``,"
"``operation_id``, etc.) sits on the handler decorator in both frameworks. "
"Application-wide options live on :class:`~litestar.openapi.config."
